---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-16 py-8 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--color-chalk-dust)]">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center text-sm text-[var(--color-chalk-dust)]">
    <p>エラーは間違いではない、発見である。</p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      © {year} Slate Errors —
      <a href="https://github.com/torifo/slate-errors" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs">
      <span class="font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-chalk-amber)] mr-2">Twin Chart</span>
      <a href="https://torifo.github.io/anchor-ports/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Anchor Ports →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
